      <li id="src-2">Boarman, W. I. &amp; Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). In A. Poole &amp; F. Gill (Eds.), <em>The Birds of North America</em>, No. 476. — comprehensive breeding data.</li>
      <li id="src-3">Heinrich, B. (1989). <em>Ravens in Winter</em>. Summit Books. — pair bonds, territory, non-breeding floaters.</li>
